---
// 演示音频是脚本合成的（CC0）。换成你自己的作品时，
// 建议 mp3（兼容兜底）+ opus（更小）双份，并用 <source> 让浏览器自己挑。
---

<section class="sound" id="sound">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Sound</p>
    <h2>音频与实时频谱</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      预加载策略是 <code>none</code>：页面打开时一个字节的音频都不下。
      点击播放后才开始加载音频，同时用 Web Audio 的 AnalyserNode 画出实时频谱。
    </p>

    <div class="player card" data-player>
      <audio
        id="demo-audio"
        src="/audio/demo.wav"
        preload="none"
        crossorigin="anonymous"
        data-audio
      ></audio>

      <canvas class="player__viz" data-viz aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

      <div class="player__row">
        <button class="player__toggle" type="button" data-toggle aria-label="播放">▶</button>

        <div class="player__meta">
          <span class="player__title">Ambient Drift <span class="muted">(示例 · CC0)</span></span>
          <span class="player__time muted" data-time>0:00 / 0:00</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="player__bar"
        data-bar
        role="slider"
        tabindex="0"
        aria-label="播放进度"
        aria-valuemin="0"
        aria-valuemax="100"
        aria-valuenow="0"
      >
        <span class="player__fill" data-fill></span>
      </div>

      <p class="muted player__note">
        替换方式：把音频丢进 <code>public/audio/</code>，改上面的 <code>src</code> 即可。
        注意：Cloudflare Pages 对 Range 请求返回 200（整体下载），拖动进度条需要等文件下完，
        所以单文件建议控制在几 MB 以内；要做真正的流式播放，就把音频放到 Cloudflare R2
        或自有服务器上（仓库里的 <code>server/index.mjs</code> 已正确实现 206 分片响应）。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { initAudioPlayer } from '../scripts/audio-player.ts';

  const audio = document.querySelector<HTMLAudioElement>('[data-audio]');
  const canvas = document.querySelector<HTMLCanvasElement>('[data-viz]');
  const toggle = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-toggle]');
  const bar = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-bar]');
  const fill = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-fill]');
  const time = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-time]');

  if (audio && canvas && toggle && bar && fill && time) {
    initAudioPlayer({ audio, canvas, toggle, bar, fill, time });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .sound {
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 7rem);
  }

  .player {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  .player__viz {
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(120px, 20vw, 168px);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05));
  }

  .player__row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .player__toggle {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.5);
    background: rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--ease), background 0.2s;
  }

  .player__toggle:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
    background: rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.18);
  }

  .player__toggle[data-playing='true'] {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
    color: #05070c;
    border-color: transparent;
  }

  .player__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .player__title {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .player__time {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .player__bar {
    position: relative;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    cursor: pointer;
    touch-action: none;
  }

  .player__fill {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    width: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
  }

  .player__note {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
  }

  .sound code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.86em;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
</style>
